  "articleBody": "Before requesting proposals for a second-story addition, gather property records, measure existing rooms, define the intended use, and identify structural or access concerns. Then compare contractors by the completeness of their design, engineering, permitting, construction, communication, and change-management plan rather than by a single preliminary price.",
